--   2. The average a sample is compared against is over the PREVIOUS
--      window, NOT including that sample (stage 1 registers the old
--      running sum).
--   3. 2-cycle latency from a sample's input edge to its signal.
--   4. One BUY (price < avg - $1), one SELL (price > avg + $1), one HOLD
--      (valid_out high, both signals low), then valid_out drops when the
--      pipeline drains.
